# Per-run full leg logs written by the gates workflow's runner
# (workflows/gates/gate-runner.zsh). A stated home on the measuring box, not
# a committed artifact: the committed record is the run's manifest, which
# names this directory and pins the tails by digest; multi-megabyte cargo
# logs do not belong in history (the repo has already paid ~2 GiB for that
# mistake once).
gates-runs/
